member what caused you to want to play the game?<font color="green">I have always played video games and when I bought my computer my sister had mentioned something about it (she has never played)and it looked like a cool game, so I thought I'd try it; little did I know......</font id="green"><br /><br />10. What are your thoughts of all the bad press EQ gets because people claim it is addictive? <font color="green">they are right, but we all have our demons, could be addicted to worse</font id="green"><br /><br />11. Your name or contact information so my professor can verify my survey source if she so wishes. (she may want to check to make sure you are a real EQ player) <font color="green">Piewakit (Cynthia <a href="mailto:Scarbrough-weezel@grics.net">Scarbrough-weezel@grics.net</a></font id="green">)<br /><br /><br /><font color="green">Good luck Huggs!-let us read your paper when you are done, please!</font id="green"></span id="msg"></font><br><br></td>
